&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;StackAdapt is the leading technology company that empowers marketers to reach, engage, and convert audiences with precision. With 465 billion automated optimizations per second, the AI-powered StackAdapt Marketing Platform seamlessly connects brand and performance marketing to drive measurable results across the entire customer journey. The most forward-thinking marketers choose StackAdapt to orchestrate high-impact campaigns across programmatic advertising and marketing channels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Manager of Client Analytics Partnership (CAP) for APAC is a leadership role combining people management, high-touch client engagement, and deep technical expertise in the programmatic advertising ecosystem. Reporting to the VP of Global Data &amp;amp; Analytics, you will lead the APAC Client Analytics Partnership team delivering strategic client reporting, advanced data insights, and custom measurement solutions across APAC regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is highly &lt;strong&gt;client-facing and relationship-driven&lt;/strong&gt;. As a trusted measurement consultant, you will partner directly with key client executives, lead strategic discovery workshops, and translate complex business goals into sophisticated, data-driven analytics frameworks. You will also bring strong &lt;strong&gt;technical depth&lt;/strong&gt; and comprehensive mastery of &lt;strong&gt;programmatic media and adtech measurement &lt;/strong&gt;to hands-on support for high-priority strategic partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;StackAdapt is a remote-first company; however, for this position, we are prioritizing candidates based in Singapore to enable regular, in-person collaboration with key regional clients and partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor the Client Analytics Partnership (CAP) team across APAC, establishing strategic goals and fostering team development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary measurement consultant for Sales and Client Service leads, driving executive-level conversations across APAC enterprise accounts and agency holdcos.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical guidance and direct support on high-priority client partnerships, measurement testing plans, learning agendas, and custom attribution frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex regional analytics requirements to scaled solutions teams and product team&amp;nbsp; to build scalable, high-impact client deliverables and data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help support recruitment and GTM of prioritised initiatives to feed the pipeline of potential case study candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with NORAM analytics leads to build enterprise-level measurement tactics, ensure efficient cross-regional project alignment, and represent APAC market needs globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advises on measurement strategy and planning in key new business development, and directly participates in client pitches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent APAC market needs to identify region-specific nuances in GTM materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the table:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in analytics, strategy, or data insights roles within adtech, media, or digital marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep programmatic expertise&lt;/strong&gt; with proven mastery in multi-channel campaign measurement, DSP/SSP data structures, and translating raw programmatic data into strategic business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge of regional ad policies and guardrails&lt;/strong&gt; on privacy and data governance laws.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong technical depth&lt;/strong&gt; with proficiency in data visualization and analytics tools (e.g., Tableau, Power BI, advanced Excel), with the ability to interface effectively with data architects and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven client-facing experience&lt;/strong&gt; partnering with major media agency holding companies and enterprise advertisers across complex multi-market environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional data storytelling&lt;/strong&gt; and executive communication skills, with a track record of influencing C-suite and senior marketing decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People management experience&lt;/strong&gt; or a strong track record as a player-coach leading cross-functional strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep understanding of measurement methodologies and strategies&lt;/strong&gt;, including incrementality, brand and engagement lift, test design, attribution models (including the limitations of last-touch attribution and application of multi-touch attribution), and marketing mix modelling (MMM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range listed for this role reflects the expected base salary for candidates located in the posting country based on a global rate. It is informed by market data and the approved budget for this position. StackAdapt maintains different compensation ranges for roles across other countries and regions, and final offers will be aligned to the candidate’s current location. &lt;em&gt;We do not ask c&lt;/em&gt;andidates about current or prior salary history, and we will not use such information, if volunteered, in setting an offer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This range represents base salary only. Depending on the role, candidates may also be eligible for additional compensation such as annual bonuses, commissions, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factors Influencing Final Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The final compensation offer will be determined by a variety of factors, which may include, but are not limited to: the candidate&#39;s specific experience, technical skills, knowledge, abilities, and relevant education, licensure, and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other business factors, such as organizational needs and budget alignment, may also be considered in the final offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Band&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$172,160&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$236,720 SGD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;StackAdapter&#39;s Enjoy:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Highly competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Retirement/ 401K/ Pension Savings globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive Paid time off packages including birthday&#39;s off!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Access to a comprehensive mental health care program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Health benefits from day one of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Work from home reimbursements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Optional global WeWork membership for those who want a change from their home office and hubs in London and Toronto&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Robust training and onboarding program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Coverage and support of personal development initiatives (conferences, courses, books etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Access to StackAdapt programmatic courses and certifications to support continuous learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;An awesome parental leave program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A friendly, welcoming, and supportive culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Our social and team events!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note: Benefits and perks may vary depending on your country of employment and the nature of your engagement. In locations where StackAdapt does not have a legal entity, employment and benefits are administered in accordance with local regulations and partner policies.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot; data-qa=&quot;closing-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;StackAdapt is a diverse and inclusive team of collaborative, hardworking individuals trying to make a dent in the universe. No matter who you are, where you are from, who you love, follow in faith, disability, superpower status, ethnicity, or the gender you identify with (if you’re comfortable, let us know your pronouns), you are welcome at StackAdapt. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;StackAdapt is committed to providing an inclusive and accessible recruitment process. Accommodations are available upon request for candidates taking part in all aspects of the selection process. If you require an accommodation, please let us know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We use artificial intelligence (AI) to streamline the resume reviews of candidates and assess their fit based on the criteria outlined in the job posting. We do not use AI to make any final hiring or interview decisions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
